// A precision optic — clusters the in-cone draw toward centre (raises the weapon's
// Accuracy). GTW-549's headline fix: a sight boosts AIM, NOT stability. Referenced by a
// weapon BY KEY (`scoped_sight`) in its `attachments:` list; the magnitude lives HERE
// on the item, never in global tuning. The effect is applied to the weapon post-spawn.
(
    display_name: "Scoped Sight",
    slot: Sight,  // GTW-554: occupies the sight dovetail — fits only a weapon declaring a Sight slot
    effects: [
        Aim(0.4),  // +0.4 to the weapon's Accuracy concentration exponent (tunable)
    ],
)
